        <mxCell id="gatewayArtifact" value="&lt;&lt;artifact&gt;&gt;&lt;br&gt;API Gateway&lt;br&gt;TLS termination&lt;br&gt;Authentication / token verification&lt;br&gt;Rate limiting / routing" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#d6b656;" vertex="1" parent="edgeNode"><mxGeometry x="20" y="65" width="200" height="125" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
